Description:
Inspection, field repairs, equipment installation, safety incident reporting, 3rd party fabrication progress reporting, and other such mobile work processes, are important aspects of many enterprises across many industries.  All these mobile work life cycles require planning, scheduling, execution of mobile work, and collection of relevant data on the mobile work.

In spite of their importance, mobile work life cycles are dysfunctional, and the typical cycle remains stuck in a paper based, clipboard and pen paradigm.  These processes are clumsy, not easy to manage, do not produce consistent and standardised outcomes, and are ineffective at collecting and retaining data.

Industry Toolbox offers a Software as a Service (SaaS) Solution that addresses the complete Mobile Work Life cycle, and offers all functionality online, and in real time.

The solution can be used across almost all mobile work life cycles, regardless of the job objective.  So whether for maintenance, safety, audit, legal compliance, or whatever other job objective, Industry Toolbox will revolutionise your mobile work mobilisation logistics and ability to collect and retain data.

Using the solution will realise the following value:
  - operational control over the complex logistics of mobilising and managing small or large mobile teams;
  - standardisation of all mobile workflows and related reports;
  - tangible savings of between 30 and 50% of the direct administration costs of current life cycles;
  - data profiles of all historic mobile work data.

The SaaS is relatively easy to adopt into an organisation, user friendly and intuitive to use, and will revolutionise the deployment logistics and data collection and retention of mobile work in your organisation.

workITsmart specializes in supporting businesses, reducing costs and increasing profitability by gaining maximum benefit from existing technology, people and business processes as an integrated environment – aligning systems for growth.
Our range of services is designed to harmonize operations across the three main assets of a business– technology, people and business processes, and include:
•	System Selection & Implementation – independently determined to best suit the current & future needs of your business;
•	System Optimization – directing resources to the most profitable activities by removing non-value adding tasks through automation and integration;
•	Dashboarding and Reporting – providing leading & lagging indicators to track progress;
•	Customized Business Insights – analytics tailored to asses specific areas.

workITsmart is proudly different because we provide a focus that:
•	Improves revenue and profitability, delivering improved ROI;
•	Drives total system alignment: Technology, People & Business processes;
•	Offers independent systems advice;
•	Is developed from a business management perspective;
•	Implements Technology & Reporting that adds value;
•	Focuses resources on profitable activities;
•	Provides technology leadership.

By understanding the current and future requirements of your business, we can deliver: 
•	Rapid returns exceeding investment; 
•	Advocacy for tailored technology and requirements with your existing providers;
•	An embedded resource and ongoing advice to enhance your business. 

To explore specific areas of improvement within your business, I would be happy to arrange a complimentary system review discussion, including an introductory survey of users that will assist in identifying any opportunities that might exist within the organisation.  Simply contact Daniel Perlstein on +61 4 1156 4880 or daniel@workitsmart.com.au to arrange a time.

