Fitzpatrick Consulting is a digital start-up providing consultancy and professional services to government, business and individuals on the digital transformation journey.

We help businesses transition their people and operations from traditional paper to a fully digital environment by developing their digital capabilities and streamlining their workplace systems and practices.

We can provide advice and assistance with:

- Digital workplace design and transformation;
- Information, records and data management;
- Information access (GIPA) and privacy;
- Governance and compliance (statutory and ISO);
- Open Government and Open Data;
- Information asset management;
- Document and records management systems (TRIM, RM8, CM9).

"Work is what you do, not a place to go."
